---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="404" description="页面不存在 / Page not found" noindex>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
		<p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500">404</p>
		<h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-white md:text-4xl">页面不存在</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-zinc-400">
			这个地址没有内容，可能是链接写错了，或者页面已经移走。
			<br />
			There is nothing at this address. The link may be wrong, or the page may have moved.
		</p>
		<div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
			<a href="/" class="rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-black transition hover:bg-zinc-200">返回首页</a>
			<a href="/en/" class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:border-white/40 hover:bg-white/10">
				English home
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
